r')\nsubmerge(reagent='Bluing Reagent', duration='1 minute')\nrinse(reagent='lab grade water', duration='1 minute', method='running water')\n\n### MANUAL SECTION ###\n# MANUAL: cover slip (reagent: Permanent Aqueous Mounting Medium (SIG-31010))",
